<title>BELARUS: BELARUS CRUDE OUTPUT SLIPS TO 1.06 MLN T JAN-JUL.</title>
<headline>BELARUS CRUDE OUTPUT SLIPS TO 1.06 MLN T JAN-JUL.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus crude output slipped to 1.059 million tonnes in the first seven months of the year from 1.086 million tonnes in the same 1996 period, the statistics ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ministry also said the former Soviet republic refined 6.78 million tonnes from 8.36 million tonnes in the same periods.</p>
<p>BELARUS OIL OUTPUT (tonnes)</p>
<p> Jan-Jul 97		  Jan-Jun 97	     Jan-Jul 96</p>
<p> 1,059,300		   903,269		  1,086,100</p>
<p>VOLUME OF CRUDE REFINED IN BELARUS (tonnes)</p>
<p> Jan-Jul 97		  Jan-Jun 97	     Jan-Jul 96</p>
<p> 6,775,600		   5,796,100		8,360,200</p>
<p>--Larisa Sayenko, Minsk newsroom +375 017 227 3594</p>
</text>
